<title>HUNGARY: Hungary Jan-April net wages up 25.8 pct-Stat Off..</title>
<headline>Hungary Jan-April net wages up 25.8 pct-Stat Off..</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average net monthly wage in the January-April period in Hungary's business sphere rose to 36,410 forints, up 25.8 percent on the similar period of 1996, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Friday.</p>
<p>This compares to a CPI increase of 18.6 percent over the same period. KSH added that while-collar workers' wages rose 11.4 percent, while blue collar workers' wages rose 2.0 percent in real terms.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327-4040</p>
